치맥 (chimaek)
Chicken plus beer. One word.

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,300
배달 왔습니다! (baedal watseumnida!)
Your delivery is here. At a park.

4
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:14,100
배달존 (baedal-jon)
Parks have official delivery zones.

5
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:18,400
맛있게 드세요 (masitge deuseyo)
Where would you order to? 👇
